.
.  Generate sample output for Fatigue Life PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na flpdf4_new.ps
device 2 postscript encapsulated
orientation landscape wordperfect
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE SIZE 6
TITLE OFFSET 3
LABEL SIZE 5
TIC LABEL SIZE 5
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability Density
X1LABEL X
.
MULTIPLOT 2 2
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 0 0 100 100
.
SET MINMAX MIN
TITLE Fatigue Life PDF (0.5 df)
PLOT FLPDF(X,0.5) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 5
TITLE Fatigue Life PDF (1 df)
PLOT FLPDF(X,1) FOR X = 0.0 0.01 5
TITLE Fatigue Life PDF (2 df)
PLOT FLPDF(X,2) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 5
TITLE Fatigue Life PDF (5 df)
PLOT FLPDF(X,5) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 5
.
END OF MULTIPLOT
.
box shadow hw 0 0
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp FLPDF4_NEW.PS flpdf4_new.ps
system rm FLPDF4_NEW.PS
.
quit
